"Flag: -trees"
msgstr ""
"所需的风景项目数量。\n"
"Flag: -trees"

msgid "% Window fill:"
msgstr "% 窗口填充率："

msgid ""
"Bottom percentage of screen available for scenery.\n"
"Flag: -treefill"
msgstr ""
"可用于风景的屏幕底部百分比。\n"
"Flag: -treefill"

msgid "Allow overlap"
msgstr "允许重叠"

msgid ""
"To allow overlap or not when placing scenery.\n"
"Flags: -treeoverlap, -notreeoverlap"
msgstr ""
"放置风景时是否允许重叠。\n"
"Flags: -treeoverlap, -notreeoverlap"

msgid ""
"Scale of scenery.\n"
"Flag: sceneryscale <n>"
msgstr ""
"风景规模。\n"
"Flag: sceneryscale <n>"

msgid "Scenery"
msgstr "布景"

msgid "Compose here your favorite celestial conditions"
msgstr "在这里定制你专属的璀璨星空"

msgid ""
"Apply default values for all preferences (except settings).\n"
"Flag: -defaults"
msgstr ""
"对所有首选项应用默认值（设置除外）。\n"
"Flag: -defaults"

msgid ""
"Apply vintage values for all preferences (except settings).\n"
"Flag: -vintage"
msgstr ""
"将复古值应用于所有首选项（设置除外）。\n"
"Flag: -vintage"

msgid "Wind"
msgstr "风力"

msgid "Windy"
msgstr "起风了"

msgid ""
"If set, there will be wind.\n"
"Flags: -wind, -nowind"
msgstr ""
"开启后，将启用风力效果。\n"
"Flags: -wind, -nowind"

msgid "Whirl:"
msgstr "回旋风："

msgid ""
"The higher this setting, the more the wind will whirl.\n"
"Flag: -whirlfactor"
msgstr ""
"此设置越高，风就越旋转。\n"
"Flag: -whirlfactor"

msgid "Timer:"
msgstr "计时器："

msgid ""
"This setting determines how many seconds pass between  two  gusts of wind.\n"
"Flag: -windtimer"
msgstr ""
"此设置确定两次阵风之间相隔多少秒。\n"
"Flag: -windtimer"

msgid "Now!"
msgstr "立即执行！"

msgid "Force a gust of wind immediately."
msgstr "立即强行吹出一阵风。"

msgid "Stars"
msgstr "星星"

msgid ""
"To show or not show stars.\n"
"Flag: -stars  (0 means: no stars)"
msgstr ""
"显示或不显示星星。\n"
"Flag: -stars  (0 means: no stars)"

msgid "Number:"
msgstr "数字："

msgid ""
"Number of twinkling stars.\n"
"Flag: -stars"
msgstr ""
"闪烁星星的数量。\n"
"Flag: -stars"

msgid "Moon"
msgstr "月亮"

msgid ""
"To show or not show moon.\n"
"Flags: -moon 1, -moon 0"
msgstr ""
"显示或不显示月亮。\n"
"Flags: -moon 1, -moon 0"

msgid ""
"Speed of moon in pixels/minute.\n"
"Flag: -moonspeed"
msgstr ""
"月球速度（像素/分钟）。\n"
"Flag: -moonspeed"

msgid ""
"Relative size of the moon.\n"
"Flag: -moonsize"
msgstr ""
"月球的相对大小。\n"
"Flag: -moonsize"

msgid "Halo"
msgstr "光晕"

msgid ""
"To show or not to show halo around moon.\n"
"Flags: -halo 1, -halo 0"
msgstr ""
"显示或不显示月亮周围的光晕。\n"
"Flags: -halo 1, -halo 0"

msgid "Bright:"
msgstr "亮度："

msgid ""
"Brightness of moon's halo.\n"
"Flag: -halobrightness"
msgstr ""
"月光晕亮度。\n"
"Flag: -halobrightness"

msgid "Meteors"
msgstr "流星"

msgid ""
"To show or not to show meteors.\n"
"Flags: -meteors, -nometeors"
msgstr ""
"显示或不显示流星。\n"
"Flags: -meteors, -nometeors"

msgid "Aurora"
msgstr "极光"

msgid ""
"To show or not show aurora.\n"
"Note: the aurora is best viewed using a dark background.\n"
"Flags: -aurora 1, -aurora 0"
msgstr ""
"显示或不显示极光。\n"
"注意：使用深色背景观看极光效果最佳。\n"
"Flags: -aurora 1, -aurora 0"

msgid "Width:"
msgstr "宽度："

msgid ""
"Width of aurora in percentage of screen width.\n"
"Flag: -aurorawidth"
msgstr ""
"极光宽度占屏幕宽度的百分比。\n"
"Flag: -aurorawidth"

msgid "Height:"
msgstr "高度："

msgid ""
"Vertical size of aurora.\n"
"Flag: -auroraheight"
msgstr ""
"极光的垂直尺寸。\n"
"Flag: -auroraheight"

msgid ""
"Animation speed of aurora: real: 10, for a more dramatic effect choose: 100\n"
"Flag: -auroraspeed"
msgstr ""
"极光动画速度：真实效果设为 10，若追求更震撼的视觉奇观请设为 100。\n"
"Flag: -auroraspeed"

msgid ""
"Brightness of aurora.\n"
"Flags: -aurorabrightness"
msgstr ""
"极光的亮度。\n"
"Flags: -aurorabrightness"

msgid "Frequency:"
msgstr "频率："

msgid ""
"Frequency of meteors to appear.\n"
"Flags: -meteorfrequency"
msgstr ""
"流星出现的频率。\n"
"Flags: -meteorfrequency"

msgid "Vertical:"
msgstr "垂直的："

msgid ""
"Baseline height of aurora, in percentage of screen height.\n"
"Flag: -aurorabase"
msgstr ""
"极光起始高度（占屏幕高度的百分比）。\n"
"Flag: -aurorabase"

msgid "Color"
msgstr "颜色"

msgid ""
"Choose between yellow-ish and white-ish moon.\n"
"Flag: -mooncolor [0,1]"
msgstr "选择月亮色调：偏黄或偏白。Flag: -mooncolor [0,1]"

msgid ""
"Size of stars.\n"
"Flag: -starsize"
msgstr ""
"星星的大小。\n"
"Flag: -starsize"

msgid "Horizontal:"
msgstr "水平的："

msgid ""
"Horizontal place of aurora\n"
"Flags: -aurorax"
msgstr ""
"极光的水平位置\n"
"Flags: -aurorax"

msgid "Position:"
msgstr "位置："

msgid "X-position:"
msgstr "X 位置："

msgid "Y-position"
msgstr "Y 位置"

msgid ""
"Horizontal position of moon if speed equals 0.\n"
"Flag: -moonx"
msgstr ""
"如果速度等于 0，月球的水平位置。\n"
"Flag: -moonx"

msgid ""
"Vertical position of moon if speed equals 0.\n"
"Flag: -moony"
msgstr ""
"如果速度等于 0，月球的垂直位置。\n"
"Flag: -moony"

msgid "Celestials"
msgstr "天体"

msgid "Birds settings"
msgstr "鸟类设置"

msgid "Show birds"
msgstr "显示鸟类"

msgid ""
"If set: show birds.\n"
"Flags: -showbirds 1, -showbirds 0"
msgstr ""
"如果设置：显示鸟类。\n"
"Flags: -showbirds 1, -showbirds 0"

msgid "Birds only"
msgstr "仅显示鸟类"

msgid ""
"If set: show no Santa, snow or scenery.\n"
"Flags: -birdsonly 0, -birdsony 1"
msgstr ""
"如果设置：不显示圣诞老人、雪或风景。\n"
"Flags: -birdsonly 0, -birdsony 1"

msgid "Preferred distance:"
msgstr "首选距离："

msgid ""
"Preferred distance from other birds.\n"
"Flag: -prefdistance"
msgstr ""
"与其他鸟类的首选距离。\n"
"Flag: -prefdistance"

msgid "Restart"
msgstr "重启"

msgid "Restart birds."
msgstr "重启鸟。"

msgid "Viewing distance:"
msgstr "观看距离："

msgid ""
"Viewing distance.\n"
"NOTE: Santa has no knowledge of viewing distance, so when birds are "
"following Santa, the relative positions of Santa and birds will be "
"temporarely out of sync when you change the viewing distance. This is only "
"noticeable when the birds are following Santa.\n"
"Flag: -viewingdistance"
msgstr ""
"视距高度。\n"
"注意：圣诞老人的移动逻辑不计算视距。因此，当开启“鸟群跟随圣诞老人”时，调整视"
"距会导致鸟儿与圣诞老人的相对位置暂时错位。这种现象仅在鸟群跟随模式下才会出"
"现。\n"
"参数：-viewingdistance"

msgid "Focus to attraction point:"
msgstr "聚焦景点："

msgid ""
"Tendency to concentrate on the attraction point.\n"
"Flag: -focuscentre"
msgstr ""
"倾向于集中在吸引点上。\n"
"Flag: -focuscentre"

msgid ""
"Desired number of birds. If zero, no birds are shown.\n"
"Flag: -nbirds"
msgstr ""
"所需的鸟类数量。如果为零，则不会显示任何鸟类。\n"
"Flag: -nbirds"

msgid "# Birds:"
msgstr "鸟类数量："

msgid ""
"Number of nearest neighbours the birds should look at.\n"
"Flag: -neighbours"
msgstr ""
"同伴参考数量：每只鸟在飞行时会参考多少个邻近同伴的动作。\n"
"Flag: -neighbours"

msgid "Neighbours:"
msgstr "同伴："

msgid ""
"Give the birds a fancy color.\n"
"Flag: -birdscolor"
msgstr ""
"给小鸟一个漂亮的颜色。\n"
"Flag: -birdscolor"

msgid "Bird color"
msgstr "鸟类颜色"

msgid "Anarchy:"
msgstr "无序度："

msgid ""
"Anarchy level: the higher, the more anarchy.\n"
"Flag: -anarchy"
msgstr ""
"混乱程度：数值越高，鸟群的飞行轨迹就越狂野（不听指挥）。\n"
"Flag: -anarchy"

msgid "Distance weight:"
msgstr "距离权重："

msgid ""
"Tendency to keep desired distance to neighbours.\n"
"Flag: -disweight"
msgstr ""
"间距保持倾向：每只鸟与同伴保持理想距离的意愿。\n"
"Flag: -disweight"

msgid "Adjust speed to neighbours:"
msgstr "同伴速度同步："

msgid ""
"Tendency to adjust speed to neighbours.\n"
"Flag: -followneighbours"
msgstr ""
"倾向于将自己的飞行速度调整至与周围同伴一致。\n"
"Flag: -followneighbours"

msgid ""
"Speed of birds in arbitrary units.\n"
"Flag: -birdsspeed"
msgstr ""
"飞行基础速度（自定义单位）。\n"
"Flag: -birdsspeed"

msgid "Drawing scale:"
msgstr "绘图比例："

msgid ""
"Influence the size of the birds.\n"
"Flag: -birdsscale\n"
msgstr ""
"影响鸟类的大小。\n"
"Flag: -birdsscale\n"

msgid ""
"Show \n"
"attr point"
msgstr ""
"显示 \n"
" 属性点"

msgid ""
"Show the point where the birds want to go.\n"
"Flags: -showattr 0, -showattr 1"
msgstr ""
"显示鸟儿想去的地方。\n"
"Flags: -showattr 0, -showattr 1"

msgid ""
"Follow \n"
"Santa"
msgstr ""
"跟随\n"
"圣诞老人"

msgid ""
"Birds are attracted by an attraction point. Here you can choose to follow "
"Santa.\n"
"Flags: -followsanta 0, -followsanta 1"
msgstr ""
"鸟类被吸引点所吸引。在这里您可以选择跟随圣诞老人。\n"
"Flags: -followsanta 0, -followsanta 1"

msgid ""
"Percentage of screen to be used for the attraction point.\n"
"Flag: -attrspace"
msgstr ""
"用于吸引点的屏幕百分比。\n"
"Flag: -attrspace"

msgid "Attraction point range"
msgstr "景点范围"

msgid "Actual mean distance from neighbours."
msgstr "与邻居的实际平均距离。"

msgid "Distance used to get the desired number of neighbours."
msgstr "用于获得所需邻居数量的距离。"

msgid "Birds"
msgstr "鸟类"

msgid "version"
msgstr "版本"

msgid "Transparency "
msgstr "透明度 "

msgid ""
"Transparency of painted items:\n"
"0: no transparency.\n"
"100: fully transparent, you will see nothing!\n"
"Flag: -transparency"
msgstr ""
"绘制项目的透明度：\n"
"0：不透明。\n"
"100：完全透明，你什么也看不到！\n"
"Flag: -transparency"

msgid "Lift snow on bottom"
msgstr "清除底部积雪"

msgid ""
"Use this if snow falls below the bottom of your screen, or  fallen snow "
"hides something that should not be hidden.\n"
"Flag: -offsets"
msgstr ""
"如果雪落在屏幕底部以下，或者落下的雪隐藏了不应隐藏的内容，请使用此选项。\n"
"Flag: -offsets"

msgid "Lift snow on windows"
msgstr "清除窗口积雪"

msgid ""
"Use this if no snow collects on your windows, or if snow  collects separated "
"from your windows. \n"
"Some basic window managers need this setting (e.g. TWM  needs in general a "
"value of 25 .. 28).\n"
"Flag: -offsety"
msgstr ""
"如果积雪没有落在窗口顶端，或者悬浮在窗口上方，请调整此项。\n"
"某些窗口管理器（如 TWM）可能需要设置垂直偏移（通常设为 25 到 28 之间），以确"
"保积雪准确落在标题栏上。\n"
"参数：-offsety"

msgid "Cpu factor"
msgstr "中央处理器系数"

msgid ""
"The higher, the smoother xsnow will run, but will also use  more cpu power.\n"
"Flag: -cpuload"
msgstr ""
"越高，运行越流畅 xsnow，但也会使用更多的 CPU 功率。\n"
"Flag: -cpuload"

msgid "Scale"
msgstr "缩放"

msgid ""
"Overall drawing scale.\n"
"Flag: -scale"
msgstr ""
"总体绘图比例。\n"
"Flag: -scale"

msgid "Ignore top windows"
msgstr "忽略顶部窗口"

msgid ""
"Windows closer to the top  than the number in this widget will not collect "
"snow.\n"
"\n"
"In some cases, there are invisible windows near the top of the screen, which "
"are handled by xsnow as normal windows: snow is collected upon them. By "
"entering a suitable number here, this undesired behaviour can be avoided.\n"
"Flag: -ignoretop\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"设置顶部忽略区域：距离屏幕顶端小于此数值的窗口将不会积雪。\n"
"\n"
"某些桌面环境在屏幕顶部存在“不可见窗口”，Xsnow 会误将其识别为普通窗口并在上方"
"堆积雪花。通过在此设置合适的数值，可以避开这些干扰区域。\n"
"参数：-ignoretop\n"

msgid "Ignore bottom windows"
msgstr "忽略底部窗口"

msgid ""
"Windows closer to the  bottom than the number in this widget will not "
"collect snow.\n"
"\n"
"In some cases, there are invisible windows near the bottom  of  the screen, "
"which are handled by xsnow as normal windows: snow is collected upon them. "
"By entering a suitable  number here, this undesired behaviour can be "
"avoided.\n"
"Flag: -ignorebottom"
msgstr ""
"设置底部忽略区域：距离屏幕底端小于此数值的窗口将不会积雪。\n"
"\n"
"某些桌面环境（如 Dock 栏或任务栏）在屏幕底部存在不可见窗口，Xsnow 会误将其识"
"别为普通窗口并在上方堆积雪花。通过在此设置合适的数值，可以避免这种干扰。\n"
"参数：-ignorebottom"

msgid ""
"Menu\n"
"colors"
msgstr ""
"菜单\n"
"配色"

msgid ""
"Toggle between xsnow's own menu colors and standard menu colors.\n"
"Activated: use xsnow colors.\n"
"Deactivated: use default colors.\n"
"Flags: -theme 1, -theme 0"
msgstr ""
"在 xsnow 自己的菜单颜色和标准菜单颜色之间切换。\n"
"激活：使用 xsnow 颜色。\n"
"停用：使用默认颜色。\n"
"Flags: -theme 1, -theme 0"

msgid ""
"On all\n"
"workspaces"
msgstr ""
"在所有 \n"
" 工作空间上"

msgid ""
"Use all workspaces to snow in.\n"
"NOTE: this doesn't work properly in enlightenment.\n"
"Flags: -allworkspaces 1, -allworkspaces 0"
msgstr ""
"在所有工作区（虚拟桌面）下雪。\n"
"注意：此功能在 Enlightenment 桌面环境下可能无法正常工作。\n"
"参数：-allworkspaces 1, -allworkspaces 0"

msgid ""
"Below\n"
"windows"
msgstr ""
"置于窗口\n"
"底层"

msgid ""
"When activated, it will be snowing below your windows, else  it will be "
"snowing upon you windows too.\n"
"On some desktop environments, when snowing above your  windows you will not "
"be able to click on any window.\n"
"Therefore, you will be asked to click a button, to be sure that  things are "
"OK.\n"
"Flag: -above"
msgstr ""
"启用时，雪花将飘落在窗口后方（不遮挡点击）；否则雪花将飘在窗口前方。\n"
"\n"
"在某些桌面环境下，若雪花飘在窗口前方，可能会导致鼠标无法点击任何窗口（被特效"
"层遮挡）。\n"
"因此，系统会要求您点击确认按钮，以确保您的桌面仍能正常操作。\n"
"参数：-above"

msgid ""
"Click to\n"
"confirm"
msgstr ""
"点击以\n"
"确认"

msgid "To make sure you can click."
msgstr "以确保您可以点击。"

msgid ""
"If you have more than one monitor, choose where you want snow falling. "
"Choose 'all monitors' if you want snow in all monitors.\n"
"NOTE: when changing monitor, xsnow will restart.\n"
"Flag: -screen"
msgstr ""
"如果您有多个显示器，请选择您想要降雪的位置。如果您希望所有监视器都下雪，请选"
"择“所有监视器”。\n"
"注意：更改监视器时，xsnow 将重新启动。\n"
"Flag: -screen"

msgid "monitor 1"
msgstr "显示器 1"

msgid ""
"Create\n"
"outline"
msgstr ""
"创建\n"
"大纲"

msgid ""
"To draw an outline around the snow window.\n"
"Flag: -outline 1/0"
msgstr ""
"在绘图区域周围绘制边框（用于调试）。\n"
"Flag: -outline 1/0"

msgid ""
"Use \n"
"screenshots"
msgstr ""
"使用 \n"
" 屏幕截图"

msgid "Use screenshots for the location of windows. Experimental."
msgstr "使用屏幕截图来确定窗口的位置。实验性的。"

msgid ""
"  \n"
"  "
msgstr ""
"  \n"
"  "

msgid ""
"Choose here the picture you want as background when  xscreensaver is "
"active.\n"
"Flag: -bg"
msgstr ""
"当 xscreensaver 处于活动状态时，请在此处选择您想要作为背景的图片。\n"
"Flag: -bg"

msgid "Choose background"
msgstr "选择背景"

msgid ""
"Activate xscreensaver.\n"
"Click and don't touch mouse and keyboard for a few seconds..."
msgstr ""
"激活 xscreensaver。\n"
"单击并在几秒钟内不要触摸鼠标和键盘..."

msgid ""
"Settings for Xscreensaver. You can choose a background, and choose to use it "
"or not.\n"
"Make sure you add a line like\n"
"xsnow -root\n"
"after the line 'programs:' in the file ~/.xscreensaver and you run "
"xscreensaver-demo to choose for xsnow.\n"
"To activate xscreensaver on the command line:\n"
"xscreensaver-command  -activate\n"
"See also the man page:\n"
"man xsnow"
msgstr ""
"Xscreensaver 联动设置：您可以选择背景并决定是否启用。\n"
"\n"
"配置步骤：\n"
"1. 编辑 ~/.xscreensaver 文件，在“programs:”行下方添加：\n"
"   xsnow -root\n"
"2. 运行 xscreensaver-demo 并从中勾选 xsnow。\n"
"\n"
"若要在命令行中手动激活屏保，请输入：\n"
"xscreensaver-command -activate\n"
"\n"
"更多细节请参阅手册：man xsnow"

msgid "Xscreensaver: "
msgstr "屏幕保护程序(Xscreensaver): "

msgid "Black"
msgstr "纯黑背景"

msgid ""
"When activated, the background will be black.\n"
"Flag: -bg  (this button will be automatically desactivated when -bg is given)"
msgstr ""
"激活后，背景将为黑色。\n"
"Flag: -bg  (this button will be automatically desactivated when -bg is given)"

msgid ""
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
msgstr ""
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"
" \n"

